Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: German layout, units, keyboard and grammar
Applies after 0079-rng-seeding.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

The German variant (BPED) as the retail German ROM lays it out: wider windows
for the longer labels (battle, bag, berry tag, PokéNav lists, Battle Frontier),
metric Pokédex units with a decimal comma, a nine-column naming keyboard with
umlauts, the contest title in one piece, the German "ENDE" tilemap and credits
timing, trainer classes named by gender, and phrases built around a name
("{STR_VAR_1}s ...") instead of appended to it. The layout values follow the
pokeemerald-german decomp; strings only the German ROM has are empty here and
filled in from the player's ROM by tools/localize_german.py. The port's own
messages get German wording, as the French and Italian ones do.

